WEBVTT

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.320
<i>Was it the past, or was it a dream?</i>

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:09.730
<i>I don't even know anymore.</i>

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:29.030
<i>But...</i>

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.540
<i>But I will never again...</i>

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:04.770
<i>allow my family...</i>

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:08.290
<i>to be taken away.</i>

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:53.050
<i>A dragon?</i>

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:55.190
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:57.710
<i>No, focus on the orcs.</i>

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:02.880
You're late.

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:04.830
Huh?

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:06.700
Who are these people?

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:09.010
They were suddenly too exhausted to go on.

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:10.920
Yeah, you can't blame them.

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:13.740
So what was it like inside?

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:15.500
Well, first...

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:23.890
<b>West</b>

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:23.890
<b>East</b>

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:23.930
Left Corridor

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:23.930
Right Corridor

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:24.010
<b>Reception Hall</b>

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:30.600
<b>North</b>

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:30.600
Front
Corridor

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.310
The big reception hall on the 
second floor, where the orcs are,

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:21.730
has a high ceiling, 
which gives them an advantage.

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:23.850
So if we're going to fight them,

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:26.970
we'll need to lure them into the 
corridor, which has a lower ceiling.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:29.910
But that has its pros and cons, too.

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:33.020
On the plus side, in a narrow corridor,

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:36.230
we can limit the orcs' 
movements to some extent.

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:39.430
On the minus side, if they sandwich us,

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:41.550
we'll have no way out.

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:45.870
So... what are we gonna do?

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:49.330
Well, I came up with 
several possible options.

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:53.930
All right! Then let's just 
do it and see what happens!

00:03:55.190 --> 00:03:58.410
Plan one is to push them off the veranda.

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:06.950
Damn! It would've worked if 
the ceiling wasn't there!

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:08.890
I told you it was low.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.430
Here it comes!

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:15.430
Come on! Over here!

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:16.990
Yes!

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:25.370
Uh, hey...

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:30.300
It's... not coming.

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:34.460
Damn. Are they being cautious 
because of the volcanic bombs?

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:40.300
Plan two. Let's go.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:43.260
Hey! Over here!

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:43.260
Over here!

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:45.540
Bring it on!

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:47.920
We'll take ya!

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.980
C'mon! Whatsa matter?!

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:54.370
We gotta run!

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:56.600
No way! We're doin' our job!

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:58.060
<i>Five,</i>

00:04:58.190 --> 00:04:59.170
<i>four,</i>

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:00.180
<i>three,</i>

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:01.100
<i>two,</i>

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.160
<i>one!</i>

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.870
Yes! I did some dama—

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:16.660
I'm behind ya!

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:26.240
<i>Plan two didn't work, either...</i>

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:29.100
<i>Wait, seriously?!</i>

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:34.250
<i>If it eats any vital organs, he won't revive!</i>

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:43.290
<i>A child?</i>

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.040
<i>The orc's?</i>

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:47.100
<i>It has hair.</i>

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:50.120
<i>Is that who the orcs in the 
castle are protecting?</i>

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:53.090
An orc child?

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:56.250
Yeah, but it was a little different.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.990
It had hair on its head.

00:05:59.070 --> 00:06:01.160
That's... the next queen!

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:01.730
Huh?

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:05.720
Most orcs are male, other than the queen,

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:07.640
and the males don't have hair on their heads.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.720
But the queen is different.

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:15.350
A queen can give birth to about a 
hundred babies in her lifetime.

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:17.950
About five of those are female,

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:22.180
and if each of those females 
births another hundred...

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:27.520
Damn, they'll multiply like crazy.

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:30.600
You really know a lot about orcs.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:32.610
I wanted to know as much as I could,

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:35.870
so I read a book we imported 
called <i>All About Orcs</i>.

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:39.650
L-Leg...

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:43.120
What else did the book say?

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:47.070
Um... It said the orcs have 
their own language...

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.520
What kind of language?

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:49.290
Huh?!

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:53.630
Uh... I only really remember one phrase...

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:56.230
Say that phrase to the orcs.

00:06:56.230 --> 00:06:57.070
What?!

00:06:57.070 --> 00:06:59.370
I-I can't!

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:01.970
I mean... I mean...

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:06.980
<b>D i k  T h r o b b</b>

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:18.270
You can just stay hidden inside.

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:20.990
I'll use you as food on my voyage.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.660
It looks like this island is about to sink.

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:33.460
Which is why...

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:37.180
I must go and collect my family.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:52.990
How did you...

00:07:57.230 --> 00:07:58.410
What do you want?

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.390
Say something!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.740
<i>That huge blade will be a problem.</i>

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:08.340
<i>But if I can get him to swing 
and miss with it once...</i>

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.310
<i>I can beat him.</i>

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:19.310
Whatever you do, don't flip 
over backwards or you're dead.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.850
I know, I know.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.520
Are y'all really gonna do this?

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.150
I want to distract the 
orcs as much as possible.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.510
Please help me.

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:29.120
G-Got it!

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:34.500
I can't believe you even thought 
to use something like this.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.120
You really are amazing.

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:42.560
<i>I never compliment other people, do I?</i>

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:46.050
<i>I think Torii's amazing for 
being able to do it so easily.</i>

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:48.350
<i>What makes us different?</i>

00:08:48.350 --> 00:08:51.910
<i>Communication skills? 
Interest in others? Pride?</i>

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:54.250
<i>No, it's all of that.</i>

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:58.390
<i>No matter who I'm with, I'm always alone.</i>

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:01.230
<i>I hate everyone, 
whether they hate me or not.</i>

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:06.290
<i>My hatred for humanity started 
with a hatred for people like me.</i>

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:11.040
<i>But since he's nothing like me, 
he doesn't fit in that category.</i>

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:15.480
<i>So even if I approved of him...</i>

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:21.750
Looks like everything's ready.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:25.000
Let's kill 'em good and dead!

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:28.280
<i>Well, whatever. That can wait.</i>

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:35.410
D*k throbb!

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:39.010
<b>"No, I am leg hair"</b>

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:39.020
<i>No, I am leg hair.</i>

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:42.400
D*k throbb!

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:46.020
<b>"No, I am leg hair"</b>

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:45.090
<i>No, I am leg hair.</i>

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:48.680
D*k throbb! D*k throbb!

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:54.230
She's 25 years old, and she's 
screaming that! What a riot!

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.780
<i>Focus, damn it!</i>

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:04.190
D*k throbb! D*k throbb!

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:14.890
Go!

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:17.080
My d*k...

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:20.080
is definitely throbbin'!

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:38.370
Yes! Our lava attack worked!

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:53.800
Looks like it's going to be a bit 
longer before the bullets are done...

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:56.910
Hey!

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:00.630
I just thought of something!

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:01.700
Wait here!

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:03.470
Okay.

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:12.100
Are you all right?

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:16.780
I-I'm fine. Sorry. Guess it's my age...

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:26.520
<i>What is this suffocating feeling?</i>

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:28.910
<i>Everyone just suddenly...</i>

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:31.710
<i>Wait, is this...</i>

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:40.920
Our life force...

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:45.210
Our life force, and the life 
force of everyone who died today

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.380
is being drained?

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:51.640
You can see the flow of life force?

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:55.310
Väikedaam can use magic, just a little bit.

00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:58.590
But who is...

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:08.000
m 0 0 l 260 0 l 260 200 l 0 200

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:08.000
<b>[Illa Long-armed Orc]</b>

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:08.000
\h\hSports very long arms, as 
the name suggests. It stands
about three meters tall with
arms reaching about two
meters, and it can live about
40 years. Most have a threat 
level of D, but the queen's 
threat level is C due to her 
larger body and higher
intelligence. They primarily
speak in Orcish, their own
unique language, but some
queens can speak the
human language, as well.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:18.630
<i>This pressure...</i>

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:24.200
<i>As long as he has that huge sword, 
I can't attack carelessly.</i>

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:30.250
<i>Three...</i>

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:32.330
<i>Two...</i>

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:33.730
<i>One.</i>

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.000
<i>He's mine!</i>

00:12:52.190 --> 00:12:54.000
I've won.

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:08.670
How did you...

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:11.740
You didn't know?

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:13.520
Heroes don't die.

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:32.770
<i>I don't need armor.</i>

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:35.320
<i>I can't stop an attack from an orc, anyway.</i>

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:38.700
<i>So I'll keep it light!</i>

00:13:44.930 --> 00:13:46.330
<i>I dodged her!</i>

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:48.430
<i>My heart's pounding!</i>

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:51.660
<i>It's no use trying to cut 
through her in one swing.</i>

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:57.350
<i>All I can do is keep cutting through 
one layer of flesh at a time.</i>

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.180
Are you all right?

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:06.050
Yeah...

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:09.540
Gramps!

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:13.670
Gramps!

00:14:18.010 --> 00:14:19.480
<i>He's burning up...</i>

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.640
<i>His breathing is heavy, 
and he's unconscious.</i>

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:31.430
<i>I have to at least get him to 
where there's some wind...</i>

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:37.220
Hot, hot, hot!

00:14:37.220 --> 00:14:38.630
Yuka-chan?!

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:40.730
Look!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:44.480
I was able to get just one 
back from an orc's body!

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:46.060
Catch!

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:47.340
Huh?!

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:50.830
H-Hang on! I'm not very good at...

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:09.600
Yuka-chan!

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:11.600
I'll be back.

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:17.070
The Orc Eater...

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:19.410
You're awake?

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:22.600
Let's draw the bow... together.

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:25.510
You got a bullet back, right?

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:27.730
Thank you...

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:31.480
But please don't push yourself too hard.

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:34.970
You are a kind girl.

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:53.240
That stings...

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:56.370
Before the hero comes back to life...

00:15:57.320 --> 00:15:59.680
I'll finish killing that one!

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.520
You were strong.

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:05.680
But...

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:07.730
Thanzamer-san!

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:09.640
Farewell!

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:28.070
I get it.

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:31.950
The waves tossed the boat onto the 
island before we even realized it.

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:37.970
<i>I have to go...</i>

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:43.510
<i>and collect them...</i>

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:48.210
<i>Mama is coming...</i>

00:16:56.930 --> 00:16:58.840
<i>I will protect you...</i>

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:06.150
<i>My family...</i>

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:15.920
We won!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:21.480
It's heading right for the lava!

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:26.500
What can I...

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:29.410
Thanzamer-san?!

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:33.420
Stop!

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:48.560
<i>I hate humans.</i>

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.260
<i>I hate them because they're 
the only species on Earth</i>

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:07.120
<i>that kills other living 
things out of malice.</i>

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:09.470
<i>I hate them because they kill things</i>

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:14.100
<i>that are inconvenient to them if left alive.</i>

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:23.700
<i>But...</i>

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:25.850
<i>I have to kill you guys</i>

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:29.540
<i>for my own convenience.</i>

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:35.770
<i>So...</i>

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:42.050
<i>feel free to hate me.</i>

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:50.580
So long.

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:19.070
<i>I'm so weak.</i>

00:19:20.310 --> 00:19:21.620
<i>Weaker than anyone.</i>

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:58.020
What's this? Why do you look so glum?

00:20:58.560 --> 00:20:59.700
No reason.

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:03.410
The wave's receded.

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:07.830
Actually, there's somethin' 
that's been botherin' me.

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:08.940
What is it?

00:21:09.560 --> 00:21:13.210
Five years ago, there was a shipwreck there.

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:14.760
Shit got wrecked?

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:17.770
Oh, a shipwreck...

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:21.050
The one the Orc Queen was riding...

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:23.580
No, the one she was bein' held on.

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:26.270
Huh? Being held?

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:32.030
There was a big cage on the ship that they 
thought the queen was imprisoned in.

00:21:32.530 --> 00:21:36.760
She'd been caught by someone 
and put on that ship,

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:39.150
and she broke out along the way.

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:44.910
Then the ship, carryin' nobody but 
the queen, reached the island.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:47.490
There was no sign of blood,

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:51.380
so we think the crew escaped 
before she could eat 'em.

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:57.620
But there was nothin' on that 
ship that showed whose it was.

00:21:58.190 --> 00:22:01.790
It couldn't have docked
at any port like that.

00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:03.660
What does that mean?

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:09.010
Most likely, they planned to either secretly 
sell the orc as a weapon or rare beast

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:12.300
or send her to an enemy nation.

00:22:12.910 --> 00:22:17.110
Oh, so maybe she was sent to 
this island to destroy it?

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:22.180
Th-That... couldn't be...

00:22:22.870 --> 00:22:24.610
We have no way to find out,

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:26.240
so we'll put that idea on hold for now.

00:22:27.150 --> 00:22:29.790
Is there anything else 
that seems odd to you?

00:22:30.800 --> 00:22:35.870
Actually, for some reason, 
everyone's life force is bein' drained.

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:36.600
Huh?

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:40.750
We Väikedaam can see it 'cause 
we can use magic a little.

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:44.710
Everyone's life force is bein' sucked 
away toward the mountaintop.

00:22:47.710 --> 00:22:49.020
You're right!

00:22:50.060 --> 00:22:52.450
But why the mountaintop?

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:55.480
The dragon!

00:22:55.750 --> 00:22:59.510
All right! You can count 
on us to look into that.

00:23:25.010 --> 00:23:26.900
Next week on <i>Million Lives</i>...

