Don't miss next week's episo!

00:23:35.980 --> 00:23:37.660
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:38.020
<b>Rock, Paper, Scissors!</b>

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:38.730
Bye!
